  "body": "Built from main at [`e22589f`](https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/commit/e22589f60170cc5105b1e86b4594adadd55af34f), committed 2026-10-24. This repository keeps the newest 30 nightlies; [the latest](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/latest) is always the newest one.\n\n## Downloads\n\n| System | Architecture | Download | Size |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Linux** | x86-64 | [AppImage](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-x86_64.AppImage) | 47.3 MB |\n| **Linux** | ARM64 | [AppImage](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-aarch64.AppImage) | 45.8 MB |\n| **Linux** | PowerPC64 LE | [AppImage](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-ppc64le.AppImage) | 45.9 MB |\n| **Linux** | PowerPC64 BE | [AppImage (Linux programs)](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-ppc64.AppImage) | 44.7 MB |\n| **Linux** | RISC-V 64 | [AppImage](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-riscv64.AppImage) | 43.3 MB |\n| **Linux** | LoongArch64 | [AppImage](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-linux-loongarch64.AppImage) | 40.0 MB |\n| **Windows** | x86-64 | [zip](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-windows-x86_64.zip) | 133.0 MB |\n| **Android** | ARM64, x86-64 | [APK](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-android-universal.apk) | 73.5 MB |\n| **macOS** | ARM64 | [zip](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-macos-arm64.zip) | 54.1 MB |\n| **iOS** | ARM64 | [IPA](https://github.com/scarletnx/nightly/releases/download/nightly-2026-10-24-e22589f/ScarletNX-ios-arm64.ipa) | 28.9 MB |\n\n- **Linux**: make the AppImage executable and run it. AppImageUpdate takes it to the newest nightly.\n- **Windows**: unzip it anywhere and run `bin\\scarletnx.exe`.\n- **Android**: Android 5.0 and later. The APK is signed with a debug key.\n- **macOS**: unzip it and open `ScarletNX.app`; signed ad hoc, so a download may need *Open* from the Finder's menu the first time.\n- **iOS**: unsigned: AltStore, SideStore or a developer account signs it for the device.\n\nMore in [USAGE.md](https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/blob/e22589f60170cc5105b1e86b4594adadd55af34f/docs/USAGE.md) and, for the app, [ANDROID.md](https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/blob/e22589f60170cc5105b1e86b4594adadd55af34f/docs/ANDROID.md).\n\n## Changes since the previous nightly\n\n[`60628f3...e22589f`](https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/compare/60628f33bedbddc1b9fcc0d833acb73886cdfdb5...e22589f60170cc5105b1e86b4594adadd55af34f): 1 change, the newest first.\n\n- \\[gui\\] A background recompile queue behind a Recompile tab ([#664](https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/pull/664))\n\n<details>\n<summary>Source and licenses</summary>\n\nThe source of this build is at https://github.com/scarletnx/ScarletNX/tree/e22589f60170cc5105b1e86b4594adadd55af34f.\n\n- The third-party libraries built into the runtime come from the release archives that cmake/dependencies.cmake lists, each checked against the SHA-256 written beside it.\n- The AppImages also bundle libraries from Arch Linux packages (Arch Linux ARM's for ARM64): their licenses are in share/licenses, and the packages in share/licenses/bundled-packages.txt.\n- The Windows zip holds the runtime DLLs it needs with their licenses in share/licenses, and the MSYS2 packages it was built with in share/licenses/msys2/build-packages.txt.\n\n</details>\n"
